# Templates are copied byte-for-byte into new projects, and the example is
# their reference copy (tests/test_wp6_new_init.py). A CRLF checkout on Windows
# made the two differ, and mixed line endings into generated manifests, whose
# product list the scaffold writes with "\n". Keep both LF on every platform;
# text=auto leaves the PNGs alone.
src/ciqkit/templates/** text=auto eol=lf
examples/** text=auto eol=lf
